        "verse": 8
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2SA",
          "chapter": 20,
          "verse": 8
        }
      ],
      "en": "When they were at the great stone which is in Gibeon, Amasa came to meet them. Joab was clothed in his apparel of war that he had put on, and on it was a sash with a sword fastened on his waist in its sheath; and as he went along it fell out.",
      "ko": "기브온 큰 바위 곁에 이르매 아마사가 맞으러 오니 때에 요압이 군복을 입고 띠를 띠고 집에 꽂은 칼을 허리에 매었는데 저가 행할 때에 칼이 빠져 떨어졌더라",
      "source_text_hash": "197475ccb2747d7a45dd46dd1f65c4e3b9d2a27aefac39a687caa57d5a35e1e6",
      "translation_text_hash": "97ba3176b7108c3166c1cc7fcca62bc0d4fd5887c0bc8ef9e66bacee7efd0c14",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "기브온 큰 바위 곁에 이르매 아마사가 맞으러 오니 때에 요압이 군복을 입고 띠를 띠고 집에 꽂은 칼을 허리에 매었는데 저가 행할 때에 칼이 빠져 떨어졌더라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
