        "verse": 18
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2SA",
          "chapter": 20,
          "verse": 18
        }
      ],
      "en": "Then she spoke, saying, “They used to say in old times, ‘They shall surely ask counsel at Abel,’ and so they settled a matter.",
      "ko": "여인이 말하여 가로되 옛 사람들이 흔히 말하기를 아벨에 가서 물을 것이라 하고 그 일을 끝내었나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "f9cbda181677f7c16f8e4af63cc50f8acbea14c2f0df1029638b7fb0378396b0",
      "translation_text_hash": "48de28123aa2dfc3826e091d49de783637840d42cb2bc1fae23a441742611475",
